{"type":"message","id":"ce6c3b09","parentId":"ad714bbd","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:16:19.154Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET requests work with X-API-Key header but POST to /send returns error 1101 (which might be a Cloudflare error or similar). Let me check if maybe the POST endpoint requires different handling - maybe it needs the API key in a different way or maybe the body format is different.\n\nLet me check the exact error format more carefully - error code 1101 typically means \"Worker rejected request\" in Cloudflare Workers. This might mean the POST endpoint itself has issues or there's a validation problem.\n\nLet me try without the header first for POST:\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-d16fd161-617d-464d-83ee-0d05a2802e08","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -v -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 19:15 UTC\"}' \\\n  \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" 2>&1 | head -30"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -v -X POST -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Heartbeat 19:15 UTC\\\"}' \\\\\\n  \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" 2>&1 | head -30\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":16565,"output":221,"cacheRead":864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17650,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779304574717,"responseId":"chatcmpl-726c5a6b-dfe6-4e68-93a9-3335b17574a9"}}
